cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "quantization-answer-fidelity: fidelity, confident error and inference energy under LLM compression"
abstract: >-
  Code and results for a study measuring answer fidelity, confident error,
  semantic entropy and measured inference energy across three open-weight
  model families at three quantisation levels, on 2,922 fixed items spanning
  a school-to-expert difficulty gradient.
